{
  "query": "OFFLINE_TIME_DEPTH",
  "description": "Time depth: % of offline variety catalog by recency bucket (last shipment vs Jun 30 2026). Offline = sales_channel NOT IN ('eCommerce','K2K','API'). H1 2026. R12 (dump exclusion) applied.",
  "run_date": "2026-07-31",
  "r12_applied": true,
  "period": "2026-01-01 to 2026-06-30",
  "cutoff_date": "2026-06-30",
  "filter": "ks_flag=TRUE, sales_channel='Offline', sales < 100000, shipping_date in H1 2026, dump accounts excluded (R12)",
  "source_view": "PRODUCTION.ANALYTICS.SALE_DETAILS + PRODUCTION.ANALYTICS.COMPANIES + PRODUCTION.ANALYTICS.CUSTOMERS (for dump exclusion only)",
  "total_companies_in_query": 205,
  "records_included": 110,
  "inclusion_criteria": "Companies with 100+ offline varieties, plus key accounts from the online comparison file. Full 205-company result available via re-running the query.",
  "methodology": "For each company+variety (product_description), find MAX(shipping_date) of OFFLINE sales in H1 2026. Bucket by days before Jun 30. % = count in bucket / total distinct varieties. Dump accounts excluded per R12 (customer_name ILIKE '%dump%','%inventory adjust%','%shrink%','%waste%','%merma%','%write off%','%sample%','%damage%','%expired%','%loss%','%trash%','%dumpster%').",
  "notes": [
    "R1: ks_flag=TRUE. R4: sales < 100000. R5: CUSTOMERS join used ONLY for dump name filtering, not for aggregation (no fan-out risk since we GROUP BY company+product_description and take MAX). R8: base tables used (Cortex-generated). R12: dump exclusion applied.",
    "Recency interpretation: high pct_0_3 + pct_4_7 = varieties actively shipping at period end = strong freshness. High pct_over_90 = many varieties only sold early in H1, stale by June.",
    "COMPARE WITH loop2_list_time_depth_v2.json (online-only, same methodology, same period)."
  ],
